    "body": "While reviving `cover_sweep.rs` (#373; it was orphaned in `uor-r4-core` — no `mod` declaration, imports unresolvable since the crate restructuring), the same audit found `crates/uor-r4-core/src/transformerless/trace_lane.rs` orphaned the same way: no module declaration anywhere, `use super::cover_sweep::…` (its neighbor, now moved) and lane machinery that nothing compiles or tests. Its text has been kept current by recent commits without ever building.\n\nMaintainer decision wanted: **delete** it, or **revive** it the way #373 revived the sweep (relocate to a crate where its dependencies resolve, wire a command, let its tests run). No position taken here — filing so the dead file is tracked rather than rediscovered.\n\nRefs #373, #374.\n",
