      "body": "## Decision (maintainer-approved): delete\n\n`trace_lane.rs` comes out. Rationale: dead since the restructuring, never compiled, and its kept-textually-current state imposes a phantom tax on every refactor while misleading readers — the exact failure mode that hid the sweep harness' orphaning until #373. Git history preserves the file completely; if the lane-comparison capability is wanted later, revival is the same mechanical move #373 made for the sweep (relocate to `uor-r4-graph-cli`, where its `cover_sweep` dependency now actually lives — its imports already point at a module that has moved out from under it). Deletion PR references the final SHA for easy revival.",
